  "body": "Re-renders `crates/ui/tests/snapshots/egui_tool_editor.png`, which went stale after #178 added the `PRB-0400` touch-probe row to the tool catalog (below the visible area, so only the properties-panel scrollbar shrinks by 10 px: a 2x10 block). The other 228 differing pixels are 1-level antialiasing noise; nothing else in the tool editor changed (independent review, PR comment). The earlier \"panic at ptr/mod.rs:847\" reading was the snapshot assertion's own panic, not a crash in the app.\n\n- Rendered on the v0.14.0 release tree, whose `crates/ui`, `crates/app/src` and `crates/tools` equal main `f4e4eac`.\n- Pinned by `egui_app::tests::tool_editor_snapshot` (camcraft-ui lib, CWD `crates/ui`): passes twice in a row against the new image.\n- Unblocks the v0.14.0 release gate, which failed on exactly this test.\n\nChangelog: none\n\nFixes #262\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n",
